{"4296700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RAILSTRIDER", "steam_appid": 4296700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your base train. To progress through the game and unlock new locations, you need to improve your train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game cycle:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid: Get in the car with your friends and explore every corner of dangerous locations in search of rare loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/5a2b17ba97d9ca1f0eb276642c068aa6.poster.avif?t=1775131553\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/5a2b17ba97d9ca1f0eb276642c068aa6.webm?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/5a2b17ba97d9ca1f0eb276642c068aa6.mp4?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade: Return to base to spend your loot. Upgrade your carriages, buy better equipment, and improve your vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/37fac4ec26402320f31ac623cfbc382e.poster.avif?t=1775131553\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/37fac4ec26402320f31ac623cfbc382e.webm?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/37fac4ec26402320f31ac623cfbc382e.mp4?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Levels: Each major train upgrade allows you to break through to the next zone. Your goal is to upgrade your train to the max and get your team to safe territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/2c408ee799044138cfda6d77735a8c58.poster.avif?t=1775131553\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/2c408ee799044138cfda6d77735a8c58.webm?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/2c408ee799044138cfda6d77735a8c58.mp4?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op for friends: Assign roles—driver or turret gunner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of locations: Explore unique biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades: Upgrade your vehicle and train base, unlock new features and diverse locations</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your base train. To progress through the game and unlock new locations, you need to improve your train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game cycle:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid: Get in the car with your friends and explore every corner of dangerous locations in search of rare loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/5a2b17ba97d9ca1f0eb276642c068aa6.poster.avif?t=1775131553\" width=688 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/5a2b17ba97d9ca1f0eb276642c068aa6.webm?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/5a2b17ba97d9ca1f0eb276642c068aa6.mp4?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade: Return to base to spend your loot. Upgrade your carriages, buy better equipment, and improve your vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/37fac4ec26402320f31ac623cfbc382e.poster.avif?t=1775131553\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/37fac4ec26402320f31ac623cfbc382e.webm?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/37fac4ec26402320f31ac623cfbc382e.mp4?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Levels: Each major train upgrade allows you to break through to the next zone. Your goal is to upgrade your train to the max and get your team to safe territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/2c408ee799044138cfda6d77735a8c58.poster.avif?t=1775131553\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/2c408ee799044138cfda6d77735a8c58.webm?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/extras/2c408ee799044138cfda6d77735a8c58.mp4?t=1775131553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op for friends: Assign roles—driver or turret gunner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of locations: Explore unique biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades: Upgrade your vehicle and train base, unlock new features and diverse locations</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Go on road trips with your friends, explore dangerous locations, and return with loot to upgrade your train. Discover new regions and reach the last safe place on earth.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/0577107eb2bb3eded2394fd282e6623f27442d6d/header.jpg?t=1775131553", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/c84cc65013c982ddd8f27a4b45c9379d4643e223/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775131553", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296700/c84cc65013c982ddd8f27a4b45c9379d4643e223/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775131553", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 650 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Waqudoo"], "publishers": ["Waqudoo"], "demos": [{"appid": 4367220, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 